    "notes": [
      "Combined course uses the Southern Loop and the eastern Northern Loop through the mapped northern crossover, bypassing the northern western technical section. The operator explicitly lists a 6.0 km alternative. Independent public course ways fix the northern branch choice; the full circuit plan identifies the two connecting course roads. Paddock, pit and karting branches are excluded. Native satellite ground resolution is 10 m. Nearest-neighbor rendering does not add resolution. Fine corner alignment and historical direction remain draft; no vertices are fitted to private diagrams, timing positions or nominal distance. Independently digitized aerial centerline: 5977.2 m. Direction, historical configuration and fine corner alignment remain draft; no course coordinates come from the comparison catalogue."
    ]
